<!-- The VOW perspective -->
<section class="section persp" id="perspective" aria-labelledby="persp-title">
  <div class="wrap grid">
    <h2 class="h2" id="persp-title">Exceptional experiences. Connected teams.</h2>
    <div class="body">
      <p class="lede">Premium, VIP and high-stakes events call for care at every level. VOW brings key staff, external collaborators and stakeholders together in one real-time environment.</p>
      <ul class="outcomes">
        <li><strong>Retire the spreadsheets</strong><span>Guest lists, groups and logistics in one live source of truth.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Automate the busywork</strong><span>Reminders, confirmations and follow-ups run on their own.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Connect your systems</strong><span>Work across the apps and legacy tools you already use.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Keep everyone aligned</strong><span>Fewer email chains and text threads to coordinate each detail.</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

