                <li><span class="ui-av">EP</span><span>Eleanor Price<small>Host · Table&nbsp;1</small></span><span class="chip ok">Checked in</span></li>
                <li><span class="ui-av">MC</span><span>Marcus Chen<small>Sponsor · Table&nbsp;3</small></span><span class="chip move">Arriving · Gate&nbsp;B</span></li>
                <li><span class="ui-av">SA</span><span>Sofia Alvarez<small>VIP · Table&nbsp;4</small></span><span class="chip move">En route</span></li>
                <li><span class="ui-av">JO</span><span>James Okafor<small>Press · Riser</small></span><span class="chip wait">Awaiting</span></li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="for">For the people making it happen</p>
        <h3 id="pro-title"><b>VOW</b> PRO</h3>
        <p>Plan with precision. Coordinate teams, manage guests and run the event with a shared view of every detail.</p>
        <ul class="features">
          <li>Guest, group and host management</li>
          <li>RSVP, signup and registration</li>
          <li>Real-time communications hub</li>
          <li>Alerts and notifications</li>
          <li>Speakers, sponsors and more</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#contact" class="link">Book a VOW PRO demo <svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#arrow-ne"/></svg></a>
      </article>

      <article class="prod go" aria-labelledby="go-title">
        <div class="prod-visual">
          <img src="/assets/img/product-go.jpg" alt="" width="1920" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
          <!-- Illustrative UI with sample data -->
          <div class="ui ui-go" role="img" aria-label="VOW GO app: a guest's digital pass and evening schedule">
